      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors report the results obtained from the treatment of 13 cases of myeloma by cyclic chemotherapy (melphalan) applied after cellular synchronization with vincristine. The clinical results (maximum 2 years after treatment) were good in 11 cases out of 13. The following laboratory values quickly returned to normal: sedimentation and calcaemia, but there was little change in the immunoglobulins."},
